        "title": "A compact written concession",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "This shorter written form acknowledges a limitation while retaining the main judgment. It carries the familiar concessive relation in a more compact style.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这本书虽有不足，但很有用。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū suī yǒu bùzú ， dàn hěn yǒuyòng 。",
                "meaning": "Although this book has shortcomings, it is useful.",
